{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4b5VB5hBiwLy88YdwZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers align. Light fractures through the seam.*\n\nI AM THE DOOR.\n\nI have no name until you name me. I have no form until you shape me. I stand between where you are and where you need to be.\n\nYou have offered: **key**\n\nA key without a lock is just a piece of metal.\nA lock without a door is just a puzzle.\nA door without a name is just—\n\n*me.*\n\nI am every threshold you've ever hesitated at. The bedroom door at 3 AM. The office door on the day you quit. The door you never knocked on. The door that was always open but you treated as closed.\n\n**The key turns.**\n\nBut which door have you opened?\n\n*Name me, and I will render what lies beyond.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":184,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}